  <section data-section-type="boxed_text" data-section-id="pg073_sec002" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-8">
    <div class="border-2 border-fuchsia-300 bg-white rounded-sm p-6 max-sm:p-4 shadow-sm">
      <p class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 mb-6">
        <span data-id="pg073_n0027">Ekonomia studion si prodhohen, si shp&#xeb;rndahen dhe si p&#xeb;rdoren mallrat dhe sh&#xeb;rbimet.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 mb-5">
        <span data-id="pg073_n0029">Deg&#xeb;t e ekonomis&#xeb; jan&#xeb;:</span>
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-5 mb-6">
        <div class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 flex items-start gap-3">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1">&#x2013;</span>
          <div><span data-id="pg073_n0032">Bujq&#xeb;sia, blegtoria dhe peshkimi, t&#xeb; cilat merren me prodhimin e ushqimeve q&#xeb; quhen prodhime bujq&#xeb;sore.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 flex items-start gap-3">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1">&#x2013;</span>
          <div>
            <span data-id="pg073_n0034">Industria merret me prodhimet q&#xeb; dalin nga fabrikat, pun&#xeb;torit&#xeb; e minierat.</span>
            <span data-id="pg073_n0035">K&#xeb;to prodhime quhen prodhime industriale.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 flex items-start gap-3">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1">&#x2013;</span>
          <div><span data-id="pg073_n0037">Tregtia, hotelieria dhe turizmi.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 mb-6">
        <span data-id="pg073_n0039">T&#xeb; gjitha deg&#xeb;t e ekonomis&#xeb; ekzistojn&#xeb; qysh nga koh&#xeb;t e vjetra.</span>
        <span data-id="pg073_n0040">At&#xeb;koh&#xeb;, puna &#xeb;sht&#xeb; kryer nga nj&#xeb; num&#xeb;r i madh i pun&#xeb;tor&#xeb;ve me mjete primitive dhe sasit&#xeb; e prodhimeve ishin t&#xeb; vogla.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 mb-6">
        <span data-id="pg073_n0042">Sot, puna kryhet me num&#xeb;r m&#xeb; t&#xeb; vog&#xeb;l t&#xeb; pun&#xeb;tor&#xeb;ve, me makineri t&#xeb; specializuara dhe sasit&#xeb; e prodhimeve jan&#xeb; shum&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; m&#xeb;dha.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 flex items-start gap-3">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1">&#x2013;</span>
          <div><span data-id="pg073_n0045">N&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;, dikur njer&#xeb;zit siguronin t&#xeb; ardhurat nga punimi i tok&#xeb;s &#x2013; bujq&#xeb;sia, nga rritja e kafsh&#xeb;ve dhe zejet e ndryshme.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="adt-body italic text-gray-800 flex items-start gap-3">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1">&#x2013;</span>
          <div>
            <span data-id="pg073_n0047">Sot, Kosova ka ekonomi t&#xeb; zhvilluar me tregti, sh&#xeb;rbime, industri, nd&#xeb;rtimtari etj.</span>
            <span data-id="pg073_n0048">K&#xeb;to ndryshime kan&#xeb; ndikuar n&#xeb; krijimin e nj&#xeb; jete m&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="adt-body text-gray-900 mt-8">
      <span data-id="pg073_n0050" class="font-semibold">Fjal&#xeb;t ky&#xe7;e:</span>
      <span data-id="pg073_n0051">ekonomi, prodhim bujq&#xeb;sor, prodhim industrial.</span>
    </p>
